@page
@{
    Layout = null;
}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Guía de estilos · SIREI</title>
<link rel="icon" href="~/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Atkinson+Hyperlegible+Mono:wght@@400;600&amp;family=Atkinson+Hyperlegible+Next:wght@@400;500;700&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/sirei.css" asp-append-version="true">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/app.css" asp-append-version="true">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/guia.css" asp-append-version="true">
</head>
<body>
<main style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 32px 64px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 56px">

<header style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 20px">
<svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" width="56" height="56" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="40" height="40" rx="10" fill="#1B6B3A"></rect><path d="M20 7 32 13.5 20 20 8 13.5Z" fill="#FFFFFF"></path><path d="M8 19 20 25.5 32 19 32 22 20 28.5 8 22Z" fill="#B7E0C4"></path><path d="M8 25 20 31.5 32 25 32 28 20 34.5 8 28Z" fill="#F2A65A"></path></svg>
<div style="flex: 1; min-width: 280px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
<p style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em">SIREI v2 · Sistema de diseño</p>
<h1 style="font-size: 40px">Guía de estilos</h1>
<p style="max-width: 760px; color: var(--c-text-muted)">Tokens y componentes de las pantallas de listado, alta y consulta. Todo está definido como variables CSS en <span class="spec">sirei.css</span>, pensado para pasarlo a <span class="spec">wwwroot/css</span> en Razor Pages. Objetivo: WCAG 2.1 AA.</p>
</div>
</header>

<section class="g-section" aria-labelledby="g1">
<h2 id="g1" class="g-h2"><span class="g-num">01</span>Principios de accesibilidad</h2>
<div class="g-grid">
<div class="card" style="padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px"><h3 style="font-size: 17px">Contraste mínimo</h3><p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--c-text-muted)">Texto ≥ 4,5:1 y controles o bordes de campos ≥ 3:1. Cada color de esta guía indica su ratio.</p></div>
<div class="card" style="padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px"><h3 style="font-size: 17px">Foco siempre visible</h3><p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--c-text-muted)">Contorno de 3 px <span class="spec">--c-focus</span> separado 2 px. Nunca <span class="spec">outline:none</span> sin alternativa.</p></div>
<div class="card" style="padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px"><h3 style="font-size: 17px">Objetivos de 44 px</h3><p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--c-text-muted)">Botones, enlaces de acción, casillas y elementos del menú miden al menos 44 px de alto.</p></div>
<div class="card" style="padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px"><h3 style="font-size: 17px">Nunca solo el color</h3><p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--c-text-muted)">Estados y prioridades llevan siempre texto. Los iconos solos llevan <span class="spec">aria-label</span>.</p></div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="g-section" aria-labelledby="g2">
<h2 id="g2" class="g-h2"><span class="g-num">02</span>Color</h2>
<h3 style="font-size: 18px">Marca y estructura</h3>
<div class="g-grid">
<div class="card sw"><div class="sw-chip" style="background: #1B6B3A; color: #FFFFFF">Aa</div><div class="sw-body"><strong>Primario</strong><span class="tok">--c-primary · #1B6B3A</span><span>Blanco encima: 6,5:1</span><span style="color: var(--c-text-muted)">Botón principal, enlaces, elemento activo</span></div></div>
<div class="card sw"><div class="sw-chip" style="background: #145530; color: #FFFFFF">Aa</div><div class="sw-body"><strong>Primario hover</strong><span class="tok">--c-primary-hover · #145530</span><span>Blanco encima: 8,9:1</span><span style="color: var(--c-text-muted)">Estado hover y pulsado</span></div></div>
<div class="card sw"><div class="sw-chip" style="background: #E3F2E8; color: #1B6B3A">Aa</div><div class="sw-body"><strong>Primario suave</strong><span class="tok">--c-primary-soft · #E3F2E8</span><span>Primario encima: 5,6:1</span><span style="color: var(--c-text-muted)">Menú activo, avatares, burbujas</span></div></div>
<div class="card sw"><div class="sw-chip" style="background: #1F5FBF; color: #FFFFFF">Aa</div><div class="sw-body"><strong>Foco</strong><span class="tok">--c-focus · #1F5FBF</span><span>Sobre blanco: 6,1:1</span><span style="color: var(--c-text-muted)">Solo para el contorno de foco</span></div></div>
</div>
<h3 style="font-size: 18px">Texto, superficies y bordes</h3>
<div class="g-grid">
<div class="card sw"><div class="sw-chip" style="background: #1A1F1C; color: #FFFFFF">Aa</div><div class="sw-body"><strong>Texto</strong><span class="tok">--c-text · #1A1F1C</span><span>Sobre blanco: 16,7:1</span></div></div>
<div class="card sw"><div class="sw-chip" style="background: #4A5550; color: #FFFFFF">Aa</div><div class="sw-body"><strong>Texto secundario</strong><span class="tok">--c-text-muted · #4A5550</span><span>Sobre blanco: 7,8:1</span></div></div>
<div class="card sw"><div class="sw-chip" style="background: #5F6B65; color: #FFFFFF">Aa</div><div class="sw-body"><strong>Placeholder</strong><span class="tok">--c-placeholder · #5F6B65</span><span>Sobre blanco: 5,6:1</span></div></div>
<div class="card sw"><div class="sw-chip" style="background: #6B7770; color: #FFFFFF">Aa</div><div class="sw-body"><strong>Borde de campo</strong><span class="tok">--c-border-strong · #6B7770</span><span>Sobre blanco: 4,6:1 (mín. 3:1)</span></div></div>
<div class="card sw"><div class="sw-chip" style="background: #D5DBD7; color: #1A1F1C">Aa</div><div class="sw-body"><strong>Separador</strong><span class="tok">--c-border · #D5DBD7</span><span style="color: var(--c-text-muted)">Solo decorativo: tarjetas y filas</span></div></div>
<div class="card sw"><div class="sw-chip" style="background: #F4F6F4; color: #1A1F1C">Aa</div><div class="sw-body"><strong>Fondo</strong><span class="tok">--c-bg · #F4F6F4</span><span class="tok">--c-surface · #FFFFFF</span><span class="tok">--c-surface-alt · #F8FAF8</span></div></div>
</div>
<h3 style="font-size: 18px">Semánticos (texto sobre su fondo suave)</h3>
<div class="g-grid">
<div class="card sw"><div class="sw-chip" style="background: #E6EEF9; color: #1F4E8C">Pendiente · info</div><div class="sw-body"><span class="tok">--c-info #1F4E8C / -soft #E6EEF9</span><span>7,1:1</span></div></div>
<div class="card sw"><div class="sw-chip" style="background: #FFF1D6; color: #7A4A00">En curso · aviso</div><div class="sw-body"><span class="tok">--c-warning #7A4A00 / -soft #FFF1D6</span><span>6,7:1</span></div></div>
<div class="card sw"><div class="sw-chip" style="background: #E3F2E8; color: #1B6B3A">Finalizada · éxito</div><div class="sw-body"><span class="tok">--c-success #1B6B3A / -soft #E3F2E8</span><span>5,6:1</span></div></div>
<div class="card sw"><div class="sw-chip" style="background: #FDECEA; color: #B3261E">Crítica · error</div><div class="sw-body"><span class="tok">--c-danger #B3261E / -soft #FDECEA</span><span>6,6:1</span></div></div>
<div class="card sw"><div class="sw-chip" style="background: #FDE8D7; color: #8A3B00">Alta · entorno PRE</div><div class="sw-body"><span class="tok">--c-alert #8A3B00 / -soft #FDE8D7</span><span>6,5:1</span></div></div>
<div class="card sw"><div class="sw-chip" style="background: #F1E9F8; color: #5B2A86">VIP</div><div class="sw-body"><span class="tok">--c-vip #5B2A86 / -soft #F1E9F8</span><span>8,4:1</span></div></div>
<div class="card sw"><div class="sw-chip" style="background: #EBEFEC; color: #3D4A43">Normal · neutro</div><div class="sw-body"><span class="tok">--c-neutral #3D4A43 / -soft #EBEFEC</span><span>8,0:1</span></div></div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="g-section" aria-labelledby="g3">
<h2 id="g3" class="g-h2"><span class="g-num">03</span>Tipografía</h2>
<p style="max-width: 820px; color: var(--c-text-muted)"><strong style="color: var(--c-text)">Atkinson Hyperlegible Next</strong> (Braille Institute) para la interfaz: diseñada para baja visión, distingue bien caracteres parecidos como I, l y 1 o 0 y O. <strong style="color: var(--c-text)">Atkinson Hyperlegible Mono</strong> para ids, fechas y tamaños. Ambas son gratuitas (Google Fonts) y se pueden servir desde el propio servidor.</p>
<div class="card" style="position: relative; overflow-x: auto">
<table class="table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Estilo</th><th scope="col">Muestra</th><th scope="col">Tamaño / peso / interlineado</th><th scope="col">Uso</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Display</td><td style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25">Incidencias</td><td class="mono">32 / 700 / 1,25</td><td>h1 de página</td></tr>
<tr><td>Título diálogo</td><td style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700">¿Finalizar la incidencia?</td><td class="mono">22 / 700 / 1,25</td><td>Diálogos</td></tr>
<tr><td>Sección</td><td style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Clasificación</td><td class="mono">18 / 700 / 1,25</td><td>h2 de tarjeta</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cuerpo</td><td style="font-size: 16px">Describe el problema que tienes.</td><td class="mono">16 / 400 / 1,5</td><td>Texto general, campos</td></tr>
<tr><td>Etiqueta</td><td style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700">Categoría</td><td class="mono">15 / 700 / 1,5</td><td>Labels, botones</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pequeño</td><td style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--c-text-muted)">Quedan 4000 caracteres</td><td class="mono">14 / 400 / 1,5</td><td>Ayudas, badges, cabeceras de tabla</td></tr>
<tr><td>Mono</td><td class="mono" style="font-size: 15px">#1507 · 03/06/2026 13:12</td><td class="mono">15 / 400 / 1,5</td><td>Ids, fechas, tamaños</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p class="hint" style="margin: 0">Mínimo 14 px en toda la interfaz. El texto se puede ampliar al 200 % sin perder contenido (unidades rem en producción).</p>
</section>

<section class="g-section" aria-labelledby="g4">
<h2 id="g4" class="g-h2"><span class="g-num">04</span>Espaciado, radios y elevación</h2>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 32px 64px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<h3 style="font-size: 17px">Escala de espaciado (base 4)</h3>
<div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 16px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px"><span style="width: 4px; height: 4px; background: var(--c-primary)"></span><span class="tok">4</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px"><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; background: var(--c-primary)"></span><span class="tok">8</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px"><span style="width: 12px; height: 12px; background: var(--c-primary)"></span><span class="tok">12</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px"><span style="width: 16px; height: 16px; background: var(--c-primary)"></span><span class="tok">16</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px"><span style="width: 24px; height: 24px; background: var(--c-primary)"></span><span class="tok">24</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px"><span style="width: 32px; height: 32px; background: var(--c-primary)"></span><span class="tok">32</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px"><span style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background: var(--c-primary)"></span><span class="tok">48</span></div>
</div>
<p class="hint" style="margin: 0">24 entre tarjetas y secciones · 16–20 dentro de tarjetas · 8–12 entre elementos relacionados.</p>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<h3 style="font-size: 17px">Radios</h3>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 20px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px"><span style="width: 64px; height: 48px; border: 2px solid var(--c-border-strong); border-radius: 6px"></span><span class="tok">--r-sm 6</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px"><span style="width: 64px; height: 48px; border: 2px solid var(--c-border-strong); border-radius: 10px"></span><span class="tok">--r-md 10</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px"><span style="width: 64px; height: 28px; border: 2px solid var(--c-border-strong); border-radius: 999px"></span><span class="tok">--r-pill</span></div>
</div>
<p class="hint" style="margin: 0">sm: botones y campos · md: tarjetas, alertas, diálogos · pill: badges.</p>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<h3 style="font-size: 17px">Elevación</h3>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 20px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px"><span style="width: 96px; height: 64px; background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-1)"></span><span class="tok">--shadow-1</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px"><span style="width: 96px; height: 64px; background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-3)"></span><span class="tok">--shadow-3</span></div>
</div>
<p class="hint" style="margin: 0">1: tarjetas · 3: diálogos.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="g-section" aria-labelledby="g5">
<h2 id="g5" class="g-h2"><span class="g-num">05</span>Botones</h2>
<div class="card" style="padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 12px">
<button class="btn btn-primary" type="button"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg>Principal</button>
<button class="btn btn-secondary" type="button">Secundario</button>
<button class="btn btn-ghost" type="button">Terciario</button>
<button class="btn btn-danger" type="button">Destructivo</button>
<button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" disabled>Deshabilitado</button>
<button class="btn btn-primary demo-focus" type="button">Con foco</button>
<button class="btn btn-ghost btn-icon" type="button" aria-label="Cerrar"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></button>
<button class="btn btn-secondary btn-compact" type="button">Compacto</button>
</div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px 24px; font-size: 15px">
<p><span class="spec">.btn-primary</span> Una por pantalla o zona: la acción que completa la tarea.</p>
<p><span class="spec">.btn-secondary</span> Acciones alternativas: guardar borrador, cambiar.</p>
<p><span class="spec">.btn-ghost</span> Navegación y acciones de bajo peso: volver, ver, cancelar.</p>
<p><span class="spec">.btn-danger</span> Solo dentro de un diálogo de confirmación.</p>
<p><span class="spec">.btn-icon</span> 44×44 y siempre con <span class="spec">aria-label</span>.</p>
<p><span class="spec">.btn-compact</span> Dentro de tablas y paneles; mantiene los 44 px de alto.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="g-section" aria-labelledby="g6">
<h2 id="g6" class="g-h2"><span class="g-num">06</span>Campos de formulario</h2>
<div class="card" style="padding: 24px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 24px">
<div><label class="label" for="d1">Normal <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input class="input" id="d1" placeholder="Texto de ejemplo"><p class="hint">Ayuda debajo, enlazada con aria-describedby.</p></div>
<div><label class="label" for="d2">Con foco</label><input class="input demo-focus" id="d2" value="Escribiendo…"><p class="hint">Contorno de foco de 3 px.</p></div>
<div><label class="label" for="d3">Con error</label><input class="input" id="d3" aria-invalid="true" value=""><p class="error-text"><svg class="i i-sm" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 8v4"></path><path d="M12 16h.01"></path></svg>Indica un título para la incidencia</p></div>
<div><label class="label" for="d4">Desplegable</label><select class="input" id="d4"><option>Selecciona una categoría</option></select></div>
<div><p class="label">Casilla</p><label class="check" for="d5"><input id="d5" type="checkbox" checked>Solo usuarios VIP</label></div>
<div><p class="label">Solo lectura</p><p style="min-height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center">Pinedo Vilches, Carlos Tomás</p><p class="hint">Texto, no un campo deshabilitado.</p></div>
</div>
<p class="hint" style="margin: 0">Con errores, además del mensaje en el campo, se muestra arriba un resumen con enlaces a cada campo (role="alert").</p>
</section>

<section class="g-section" aria-labelledby="g7">
<h2 id="g7" class="g-h2"><span class="g-num">07</span>Badges, alertas y tabla</h2>
<div class="card" style="padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px"><strong style="width: 110px">Estado</strong><span class="badge b-info">Pendiente</span><span class="badge b-warning">En curso</span><span class="badge b-success">Finalizada</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px"><strong style="width: 110px">Prioridad</strong><span class="badge b-danger">Crítica</span><span class="badge b-alert">Alta</span><span class="badge b-neutral">Normal</span><span class="badge b-neutral">Baja</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px"><strong style="width: 110px">Otros</strong><span class="badge badge-plain b-vip"><svg class="i i-sm" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"></path></svg>VIP</span><span class="badge b-alert">Entorno PRE</span><span class="badge b-warning">Cambios sin guardar</span></div>
</div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px">
<div class="alert alert-info"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg><p>Información o contexto</p></div>
<div class="alert alert-success"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><p>Acción completada</p></div>
<div class="alert alert-warning"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg><p>Atención: solo CAU</p></div>
<div class="alert alert-error"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 8v4"></path><path d="M12 16h.01"></path></svg><p>Error que bloquea</p></div>
</div>
<div class="card" style="position: relative; overflow-x: auto">
<table class="table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Id</th><th scope="col">Incidencia</th><th scope="col">Estado</th><th scope="col">Prioridad</th><th scope="col"><span class="sr-only">Acciones</span></th></tr></thead>
<tbody><tr><td class="mono" style="color: var(--c-text-muted)">1507</td><td><a href="#g7" style="font-weight: 700">Probando</a></td><td><span class="badge b-info">Pendiente</span></td><td><span class="badge b-neutral">Normal</span></td><td style="text-align: right"><button class="btn btn-secondary btn-compact" type="button">Asignarme</button></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p class="hint" style="margin: 0">Tabla: el título es el enlace principal de la fila; cabeceras con scope; caption oculto con el resumen; en móvil, desplazamiento horizontal dentro de su caja.</p>
</section>

<section class="g-section" aria-labelledby="g8">
<h2 id="g8" class="g-h2"><span class="g-num">08</span>Iconografía</h2>
<div class="card" style="padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px">
<span style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg><span class="tok">search</span></span>
<span style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg><span class="tok">plus</span></span>
<span style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12s3-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3 7-10 7-10-7-10-7Z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg><span class="tok">eye</span></span>
<span style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg><span class="tok">lock</span></span>
