<tbody>
<tr><td>Tokens y componentes</td><td><span class="spec">wwwroot/css/sirei.css</span> (variables <span class="spec">--c-*</span>, <span class="spec">--r-*</span>, <span class="spec">--shadow-*</span> y clases <span class="spec">.btn</span>, <span class="spec">.input</span>, <span class="spec">.badge</span>…)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cabecera, menú y pie</td><td><span class="spec">Pages/Shared/_Layout.cshtml</span>, con enlace para saltar al contenido</td></tr>
